    "Drag up to look at the floor. Lift the loose board under the desk and take what's there."
   ],
   "solve": [
    {
     "set": "board_up"
    },
    {
     "give": "watch"
    },
    {
     "set": "watch_taken"
    },
    {
     "journal": [
      "watch",
      "Wren's watch",
      "His pocket watch, stopped, hidden under a floorboard beneath his desk. The hands stand at twenty past ten. Engraved on the back: OUR HOUR. H.W.\n\nTwenty past ten. The hour he always kept free for me on Thursdays."
     ]
    }
   ],
   "said": "The board lifts. Wren's watch is in your hand."
  },
  {
   "id": "clock",
   "done": "clock_open",
   "hints": [
